{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"update","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"entryID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/EntryID","text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tempo","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming5TempoV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/Tempo","text":"Tempo","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"extras","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10XestiTools6ExtrasV","text":"Extras","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil) -> (updated","kind":"text"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", removedEntryID","kind":"text"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/EntryID","text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?)","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"entryID","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The identity of the entry to replace. An","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identity naming no entry is ignored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"tempo","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The new tempo for the entry.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"extras","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The new optional extra data for the entry."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A pair of "},{"code":"updated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if ","type":"text"},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" identified an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entry and it was updated, ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"text":" named no","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entry and nothing happened — and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"removedEntryID"},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"identity of the pre-existing entry dropped because the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edit collapsed into it (see above). ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"updated"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or if it is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" but no such collision","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"occurred."}]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/UsingIvorTiming"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/remove(entryID:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" followed by an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/insert(beatTime:tempo:extras:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", this"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"keeps the entry’s identity and does not reorder entries. Reordering only matters when more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than one entry shares a beat time: insertion always lands after every entry already at that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"beat time, so a remove-then-insert edit of one entry among ties silently changes the order of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entries that were never touched. And — unlike a position — the identity keeps addressing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"this same entry across any other entry’s edit, so a caller never needs to re-resolve it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The edit can turn this entry into an exact duplicate of another one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already at the same beat time — same beat time, tempo, and extras —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same combination "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/insert(beatTime:tempo:extras:)"},{"type":"text","text":" silently"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collapses. When that happens, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"type":"text","text":" always keeps addressing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entry that was just updated; the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"other"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", pre-existing entry is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one silently removed instead. That is the only choice consistent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the guarantee above: a caller invoking this method already"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holds "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"type":"text","text":" and goes on using it afterward, so honoring “this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identity keeps addressing this same entry” means the entry it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wasn’t referencing has to be the one that gives way, never the one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it was."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivortiming\/tempomap\/update(entryid:tempo:extras:)"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/update(entryID:tempo:extras:)"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Replaces the tempo entry with the given identity, in place."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming","doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV6update7entryID5tempo6extrasSb7updated_AC05EntryG0VSg07removedkG0tAJ_AA0C0V10XestiTools6ExtrasVSgtF","title":"update(entryID:tempo:extras:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"update"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"entryID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntryID"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tempo"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming5TempoV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tempo"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"extras"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10XestiTools6ExtrasV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Extras"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) -> (updated"},{"kind":"text